---
source: tests/show.rs
expression: "show(\"mcp\")"
---
Claude Code configuration for <tmp>/project

Sources
  project      ./.claude/settings.json
  state        ~/.claude.json
  project mcp  ./.mcp.json

Workspace trust: accepted

Permissions
  mode: default (not set)
  deny: none
  ask: none
  allow: none
  additionalDirectories: none

Hooks
  none

MCP servers
  local-only  local    stdio: ./bin/local-mcp
  approved    project  stdio: uvx approved-server  env: API_KEY  (approved)
  no-type     project  missing type: https://no-type.example.com/mcp  (skipped: url without type is read as stdio and skipped)
  off         project  stdio: off-server  (disabled)
  pending     project  http: https://pending.example.com/mcp  (not approved: prompts interactively, loads without a prompt in -p and SDK runs)
  shared      project  stdio: npx -y project-server  (not approved: prompts interactively, loads without a prompt in -p and SDK runs)  (overrides user)
  user-only   user     http: https://mcp.example.com/mcp  headers: Authorization

Settings that run commands
  none

Environment (values hidden)
  none

Sandbox
  not configured (off by default)

Plugins (hooks and MCP servers from plugins are not read yet)
  none
